# Optional Xbox Controls integration. The controller module is built from the
# author-approved source; the runtime is the MIT KOTOR Patch Manager hook engine.
!third_party/Included/KPM-Xbox-Controls-K1-1.2 by Saul0097/

# Raw game screenshots used to build the comparison images. The composites in
# assets/screenshots/ are committed because the README and the mod pages need
# them; these originals are 22 MB and reproduce nothing -- a screenshot depends on
# a save and a camera position, not on anything in this repository. Keep them
# locally to re-caption or re-crop a composite.
assets/screenshots/3440x1440/

# The controller module is built from tracked source in src/controller-native/.
# Its build output is not tracked.
src/controller-native/*.module
src/controller-native/*.obj
src/controller-native/*.exp
src/controller-native/*.lib

# Strays left in the repository root by running the game or the patcher from
# here. swkotor.ini is the game's own settings; K1DriverCompat.ini is the
# settings file the patcher writes next to the game, all of whose lines ship
# commented out. Neither is a build input, and the real copies live beside the
# install. Existing copies under build/ are already ignored.
swkotor.ini
K1DriverCompat.ini

# .NET build output of the macOS package tool (macos/build.sh)
macos/tools/kpm-cli/bin/
macos/tools/kpm-cli/obj/
